01:24.000 --> 01:28.000
You'll get more comfortable with this concept as you advance in your Python journey.

01:28.000 --> 01:39.000
But know that if you are going to be using a lot of or all of the definitions from a module, go ahead and import that top level module.

01:39.000 --> 01:46.000
If you just want to use one thing, stick with the best practice of only importing what you need.

01:47.000 --> 01:52.000
